# flyclaude needs NO credentials.
#
# The connectome comes from a public Google Cloud Storage bucket with no auth,
# and the AI half shells out to the `claude` CLI, which uses the login you
# already have. There is nothing to put in this file.
#
# It exists only so that if you later add something that DOES need a key, it
# lands here -- and .gitignore is already set up to keep it out of the repo.
#
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
